# Authored and reviewed on several machines: pin LF everywhere so a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true cannot rewrite the sources and produce
# spurious diffs. The workflows are the part that actually breaks — a CRLF
# `run: |` block reaches bash with a trailing \r on every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
